This dataset — the derived statistics only (token counts, premium ratios,
confidence intervals) — is released under CC0 1.0 Universal (Public Domain
Dedication). Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

No original sentence text from the source parallel corpora is redistributed
here; only aggregate/per-sentence statistics computed from them. The source
corpora carry their own licenses — see the dataset card for attribution:
- FLORES-200 (facebook/flores): CC-BY-SA-4.0
- OPUS-100 (Helsinki-NLP/opus-100): mixed per-source licenses, see
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/Helsinki-NLP/opus-100
- Bible corpus (davidstap/biblenlp-corpus-mmteb): see
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/davidstap/biblenlp-corpus-mmteb
